body=pagehero('Our Services','Explore technical contracting and property improvement service categories. Final scope depends on your project requirements.')+f'''<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Service areas</span><h2>Solutions for your property</h2><p>Choose a service to learn about typical work and the details to discuss when requesting a quotation. Please confirm current service availability directly before booking.</p></div><div class="service-grid">{''.join(f'<article class="service-card"><img src="{s[3]}" alt="{s[0]}" loading="lazy"><div class="service-card-body"><h3>{s[0]}</h3><p>{s[1]}</p><a class="text-link" href="/services/{s[2]}.html">View service details →</a></div></article>' for s in services)}</div></div></section><section class="cta-band"><div class="container"><div><h2>Not sure which service you need?</h2><p>Describe the issue or planned improvement and ask us about the next step.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/contact.html">Request a Quote →</a></div></section>'''
