(root/'README.md').write_text('''# NOVA Technical Contracting — Website Starter\n\nA responsive, static multi-page corporate website with shared navigation/footer, service pages, SEO metadata, sitemap, robots.txt, and a contact form UI.\n\n## Important before launch\n- “NOVA Technical Contracting” is a demo brand. Replace it with the actual company name and logo.\n- Replace `https://www.example.com` in canonical URLs, structured data, robots.txt, and sitemap.xml with the production domain.\n- Replace `info@example.com` and add verified contact details.\n- The contact form is **not connected** to a backend; connect Formspree, Netlify Forms, or your own endpoint before launch.\n- Service descriptions are generic draft copy. Confirm the company actually offers each service and edit the content accordingly.\n- Project imagery is illustrative, not evidence of company work. Replace with authorised real project photos before publishing.\n- Review the Privacy Policy and Terms pages for legal accuracy.\n\n## Run locally\nOpen `index.html` in a browser, or serve the folder with a static server. For clean URL handling, deploy the folder to Netlify, Vercel, GitHub Pages, or a conventional static host.\n\n## Files\n- `index.html`, `about.html`, `services.html`, `projects.html`, `contact.html`\n- `services/` — individual service pages\n- `assets/styles.css` — responsive design system\n- `assets/site.js` — shared header/footer and menu interaction\n''')
